 $L TAKE LIST $L KEY_WIN $L 0 END TAKE $L TAKE LIST $L KEY_WIN $L 0 END TAKE
 $L TAKE LIST $L KEY_MENU $L 0 END TAKE
END TAKE TO keymap VALUE
